c6=A.a([A.x(h8,"The maximum (limit) is 10 Faan. Once you hit 10 Faan, extra Faan don't increase payment further.",h9,h9),A.x(h8,"There are 12 automatic limit hands (\u4f8b\u724c), all counted as 10 Faan (the maximum): All Honors (\u5b57\u4e00\u8272), Small Four Winds (\u5c0f\u56db\u559c), Big Four Winds (\u5927\u56db\u559c), All Concealed Pungs (\u574e\u574e\u7cca), Eighteen Arhats (\u5341\u516b\u7f85\u6f22), All Terminals (\u6e05\u4e48\u4e5d), Heavenly Hand (\u5929\u7cca), Earthly Hand (\u5730\u7cca), Thirteen Orphans (\u5341\u4e09\u4e48), Kong-on-Kong Self-draw (\u69d3\u4e0a\u69d3\u81ea\u6478), Nine Gates (\u4e5d\u5b50\u9023\u74b0), Big Flower Win (\u5927\u82b1\u7cca).",h9,h9),A.x(h8,"Heavenly Hand (\u5929\u7cca): The dealer wins on their initial 14 tiles! Earthly Hand (\u5730\u7cca): Non-dealer wins on their first draw. Both are instant limit!",h9,h9),A.x(h8,"On the common table, 10 Faan = $128 is the cap. Whether you have 10 Faan or 13 Faan, payment is the same $128. But the bragging rights differ!",h9,h9)],n5)
