e9=A.a([A.x(h8,'Real games have pressure! Someone declares "Pong!" loudly, the wall is running low, and you need to decide quickly. Let\'s practice staying calm.',h9,h9),A.x(h8,"Pressure situation 1: You're 1 tile from winning, but the only tile you can discard is dangerous. Push or fold?",h9,h9),A.x(h8,"Framework: Risk = (chance of dealing in) \xd7 (cost if dealt in). Reward = (chance of winning) \xd7 (value of your hand). If Reward > Risk, push!",h9,h9),A.x(h8,"Pressure situation 2: Two opponents seem close to winning. Do you play safe against both? Usually yes \u2014 fold and wait for the next hand!",h9,h9)],n5)
